    "Old aliases list is historical recognition, current request host lookup only current Business.link_alias; coordinated old-host path/query redirects required",
    "Link branding not automatic trust/consent/identity/sale/attribution; do not open live message-specific tracking URLs for screenshots",
    "DNS provider-specific host/target, same-name conflicts, apex ALIAS restrictions versus flattening, HTTPS service/certificate separate from DNS"
